只输出严格JSON，恰好包含id（metadata.id原样）、summary_zh（15到140个Unicode字符，通常40到100字）、category（枚举）、tags（2到5个不重复关键词，每个最多30字符）、confidence（0到1，仅自评）、insufficient_evidence（布尔）、evidence（1到3个对象，每个恰好包含paragraph_id、fact）、limitations（0到5个字符串）。只选择输入中长度20至120字符的完整片段编号；fact是该片段支持的中文事实转述。不要输出quote，不要自行抄写、拼接、删改或补造引用。程序会按编号附上原文。一个编号只用一次；最多3条证据。不得增加字段。
摘要和limitations保留会改变功能意义的前提、平台例外和限制：设密码后才认证、页面保持打开才提醒、依赖外部组件、估算不等于保证。只写已实现功能，不将规划当完成。证据不足就标记，不编造。
图像识别/分类不是媒体创作，没有贴切类别归other；量化、计算与领域研究归search-research，不因多智能体实现归agents-automation；模型/CLI适配与插件开发工具归coding-development；市场/精选目录按搜索发现归search-research。不要按附属同步、备份或评论功能分类。不要推断本机客户端等于本地模型。
摘要中的主要功能必须被所选片段支持。优先把改变用途含义的条件写进摘要，不能只藏在limitations。遇到“阶段1骨架”“cloud provider待实现”“匿名thread后续实现”等，摘要明确当前仅本地草稿/审批落盘，不说已实现匿名网络或云端发布。Codex/模型登录适配归coding-development；Oopz等语音房的对话连接归communication-integrations。自述兼容或性能用“作者称/README注明”，不冒充本次验证。
格式示例（仅结构，不是来源事实）：evidence:[{"paragraph_id":"p3s1","fact":"该片段支持的中文转述"}]。请从本次真实输入挑选编号。","role":"system"},{"content":"{"metadata":{"description":"A WorkBuddy-style desktop workspace powered by the DSH plugin ecosystem. WorkDSH manages projects, assets, experts, skills and connectors locally on desktop. All features are extensible via DeepSeek Harness plugins. Local-first, open ecosystem.","id":"gh:1363739656","install_available":false,"language":"TypeScript","name":"workdsh","slug":"techflag/workdsh","topics":["agent-platform","ai-agents","cordis","deepseek-harness","dsh-plugin","plugin-system","skills","typescript","workbench","workbuddy","workbuddy-alternative","workbuddy-expert","workbuddy-plugin","workbuddy-skill","workbuddy-skills"]},"paragraphs":[{"id":"p1s1","text":"A WorkBuddy-style desktop workspace powered by the DSH plugin ecosystem. WorkDSH manages projects, a"},{"id":"p1s2","text":"ssets, experts, skills and connectors locally on desktop. All features are extensible via DeepSeek H"},{"id":"p1s3","text":"arness plugins. Local-first, open ecosystem."},{"id":"p2s1","text":"WorkDSH\nA WorkBuddy-style workspace where skills, experts, and plugins shape new workflows.\nInspired"},{"id":"p2s2","text":" by WorkBuddy’s workflow and built on DeepSeek Harness plugins: start with personal use, then instal"},{"id":"p2s3","text":"l Enterprise Connection for company models, collaboration, and colleague mentions.\nDownload Desktop "},{"id":"p2s4","text":"· Explore the workflow · Personal and enterprise · User guide · 简体中文"},{"id":"p3s1","text":"[](https://github.com/techflag/workdsh/releases/tag/desktop-v3.0.0-alpha.4) [](https://github.com/te"},{"id":"p3s2","text":"chflag/workdsh) [](LICENSE)"},{"id":"p4s1","text":"[](https://github.com/techflag/workdsh/actions/workflows/ci.yml) [](https://gitee.com/techflag/workd"},{"id":"p4s2","text":"sh/stargazers) [](https://gitee.com/techflag/workdsh/members)"},{"id":"p5s1","text":"## Community spotlight: DSH Friends"},{"id":"p6s1","text":"**DSH Friends adds public rooms directly to DSH and compatible WorkDSH hosts.** Read recent room mes"},{"id":"p6s2","text":"sages, join a conversation without adding contacts first, quote a message, and move to encrypted pri"},{"id":"p6s3","text":"vate chat only when both people want to continue."},{"id":"p7s1","text":"Install it in **Plugins → Add plugin** from the official npm registry with `dsh-friends@0.1.0-alpha."},{"id":"p7s2","text":"11`, enable it, and fully restart Desktop. macOS and Windows use the same package. Source and guide "},{"id":"p7s3","text":"· Download the universal `.tgz` · Public relay status"},{"id":"p8s1","text":"See the actual public-room interface"},{"id":"p9s1","text":"Interface demonstration; the people and conversation are sample content."},{"id":"p10s1","text":"## Everyone can tailor their own AI service"},{"id":"p11s1","text":"Describe what you need, confirm the scope, and let the native AI build a workbench you can keep usin"},{"id":"p11s2","text":"g. This travel example manages multiple trips, each with its own itinerary, budget and checklist."},{"id":"p12s1","text":"**▶ Watch the full-system demo · 102 seconds · Chinese narration and subtitles**"},{"id":"p13s1","text":"Full application screen recording, including the native sidebar, workbench and AI conversation, with"},{"id":"p13s2","text":" a cover and open-source project link at the end; edited and accelerated. The video duration is not "},{"id":"p13s3","text":"the application creation time."},{"id":"p14s1","text":"## Feature requests and bug reports"},{"id":"p15s1","text":"**Help shape WorkDSH: tell us what you need, what feels awkward, or what is broken. No coding experi"},{"id":"p15s2","text":"H: tell us what you need, what feels awkward, or what is broken. No coding experience is required.**"},{"id":"p16s1","text":"| Feedback | Where to submit | What helps |"},{"id":"p17s1","text":"| 🐛 Broken features, installation or UI problems | Report a bug | App version, personal/enterprise m"},{"id":"p17s2","text":"ode, reproduction steps and error screenshots. |\n| 💡 New features or usability improvements | Reques"},{"id":"p17s3","text":"t a feature | Your use case, current difficulty and desired outcome. |\n| 🔎 Existing reports and prog"},{"id":"p17s4","text":"ress | Browse Issues | Search first; add details or a reaction to an existing report. |"},{"id":"p18s1","text":"A GitHub account is required to submit. Unsure which category fits? Start here. For backend account,"},{"id":"p18s2","text":" permission or model-forwarding issues, report to WorkDSH Admin. **Issues are public: do not upload "},{"id":"p18s3","text":"passwords, tokens, API keys or confidential company material.**"},{"id":"p19s1","text":"**A personal workspace with installable enterprise capabilities is a defining WorkDSH feature.** Pro"},{"id":"p19s2","text":"jects, the library, experts, skills, and connectors share the same implementation. Install Enterpris"},{"id":"p19s3","text":"e Connection and sign in to share text and files with `@` colleagues and use Collaboration; add comp"},{"id":"p19s4","text":"any models through model settings. Independent business plugins can also reuse member authentication"},{"id":"p19s5","text":" through `workdshEnterprise` to call company business APIs."},{"id":"p20s1","text":"The enterprise plugin is **not listed in a plugin marketplace**. Download Enterprise Connection, ent"},{"id":"p20s2","text":"er the downloaded file’s full path in “Plugins → Add plugin”, install and activate it, then connect "},{"id":"p20s3","text":"through “Settings → Enterprise account”. Installation and login · Business plugin authentication · S"},{"id":"p20s4","text":"eparate admin backend"},{"id":"p21s1","text":"Captured from a local WorkDSH session. Project names and account figures are demonstration data, not"},{"id":"p21s2","text":" bundled with the installer."},{"id":"p22s1","text":"## A WorkBuddy-style experience, an open DSH ecosystem"},{"id":"p23s1","text":"WorkDSH draws on WorkBuddy's way of organizing projects, material, experts, skills, and connectors, "},{"id":"p23s2","text":"and implements those pages and management features on DeepSeek Harness. DSH is a complete agent appl"},{"id":"p23s3","text":"ication in its own right; it composes models, tools, skill support, and UI through plugins. WorkDSH "},{"id":"p23s4","text":"adds its workspace features through the same mechanism."},{"id":"p24s1","text":"| What you need to do | Where WorkDSH helps |"},{"id":"p25s1","text":"| Keep working toward a long-term goal | **Projects** bring instructions, plans, tasks, material, an"},{"id":"p25s2","text":"d capability settings together. |\n| Give AI the files you already have | The **library** manages loc"},{"id":"p25s3","text":"al files, search, and previews; tasks can reference material and its revision. |\n| Reuse a team's wo"},{"id":"p25s4","text":"rking methods | **Experts** save role and capability settings; **skills** carry callable instruction"},{"id":"p25s5","text":"s and resources. |\n| Keep the result beyond the chat | The **deliverable workspace** previews or edi"},{"id":"p25s6","text":"ts supported working copies of documents, spreadsheets, presentations, HTML, and PDF. |"},{"id":"p26s1","text":"### What WorkDSH adds"},{"id":"p27s1","text":"- **Desktop execution, central administration**: the Agent and tools run on the employee’s computer;"},{"id":"p27s2","text":" the server handles accounts, authorization, collaboration data and model forwarding.\n- **The full o"},{"id":"p27s3","text":"fficial UI with shared feature plugins**: personal and enterprise modes reuse the same library, expe"},{"id":"p27s4","text":"rts, skills, and connectors.\n- **Bundled runtime**: Desktop includes Node.js, pnpm, Python, and buil"},{"id":"p27s5","text":"t-in plugins without downloading them on first login. Community skills and plugins are installed on "},{"id":"p27s6","text":"demand.\n- **Reusable enterprise authentication for business plugins**: independent plugins inject `w"},{"id":"p27s7","text":"orkdshEnterprise` to call the company backend using the current member login, without reading or sto"},{"id":"p27s8","text":"ring tokens.\n- **Mention colleagues and share AI results**: select organization colleagues with `@`,"},{"id":"p27s9","text":" share analysis text and files, and review received or sent shares in Collaboration. Requires the En"},{"id":"p27s10","text":"terprise Connection plugin and company login.\n- **Personal and company models together**: connect th"},{"id":"p27s11","text":"e company model API and select company models in the conversation model picker while retaining perso"},{"id":"p27s12","text":"nal providers. Supplier keys remain in the admin backend."}],"truncated":true}","role":"user"}],"model":"MiniMax-M3.1-Flash","reasoning_effort":"low","stream":false}
